    <briefdescription>
<para>Streams retrieved documents one at a time, filling the context window incrementally. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">StreamingRetrieverConfig<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.max_context_tokens<sp/>=<sp/>8192;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.sort_by_relevance<sp/><sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">true</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
